WEBVTT

00:00:07.122 --> 00:00:09.820
♪

00:00:09.863 --> 00:00:11.604
[ whispering]:
I think...

00:00:11.648 --> 00:00:14.781
someone's coming aboard!

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.700
[ panting]

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:25.792
[ ice crackling softly]

00:00:35.454 --> 00:00:37.978
[ gasps, shivers]

00:00:38.022 --> 00:00:41.591
Bloody hell!
What's happening?!

00:00:43.984 --> 00:00:47.684
[ wind whistling]

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:56.693
[ soft, muffled whooshing]

00:01:00.914 --> 00:01:11.142
[ fingers crackling]

00:01:11.186 --> 00:01:12.578
[ gasps]

00:01:12.622 --> 00:01:16.191
[ cat snarls][ rat squeaks]

00:01:17.192 --> 00:01:21.413
[ distorted whooshing]

00:01:22.022 --> 00:01:26.636
[ distorted whooshing
continues]

00:01:33.164 --> 00:01:35.688
[ whooshing continues]

00:01:45.176 --> 00:01:47.091
[ muted shrieking]

00:01:47.135 --> 00:01:50.877
WOMAN [ screaming]:
Harry...!

00:01:50.921 --> 00:01:53.663
[ train whistle fading]

00:01:53.706 --> 00:01:56.187
HERMIONE [ echoing]:
Harry?

00:01:56.231 --> 00:01:58.058
Harry, you all right?

00:01:58.102 --> 00:02:01.236
[ train wheels clacking]

00:02:04.717 --> 00:02:06.980
Thank you.

00:02:07.024 --> 00:02:09.635
Here, eat this.
It'll help.

00:02:09.679 --> 00:02:13.161
It's all right.
It's chocolate.

00:02:17.817 --> 00:02:20.516
Wha-What was that
thing... that came?

00:02:20.559 --> 00:02:23.388
It was a dementor, one
of the guards of Azkaban.

00:02:23.432 --> 00:02:24.737
It's gone now.

00:02:24.781 --> 00:02:26.870
It was searching the train
for Sirius Black.

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:28.915
If you'll excuse me,
I need to have

00:02:28.959 --> 00:02:32.832
a little word
with the driver.

00:02:35.792 --> 00:02:40.362
Eat. You'll feel better.

00:02:44.104 --> 00:02:45.323
What happened to me?

00:02:45.367 --> 00:02:47.064
Well, you sort of
went rigid.

00:02:47.107 --> 00:02:50.720
W-We thought maybe you were
having a fit or something.

00:02:51.024 --> 00:02:54.811
And-and did either of you two...

00:02:54.854 --> 00:02:57.379
you know... pass out?

00:02:57.422 --> 00:03:00.730
No. I felt weird, though.

00:03:00.773 --> 00:03:03.254
Like I'd never be
cheerful again.

00:03:03.298 --> 00:03:06.866
But someone was screaming.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.259
A woman.

00:03:08.303 --> 00:03:11.871
No one was screaming, Harry.

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:20.315
♪

00:03:23.143 --> 00:03:27.278
CHOIR:
♪ In the cauldron
boil and bake ♪

00:03:27.322 --> 00:03:30.368
♪ Fillet of a fenny snake

00:03:30.412 --> 00:03:33.676
♪ Scale of dragon,
tooth of wolf ♪

00:03:33.719 --> 00:03:35.112
♪ Witches' mummy

00:03:35.155 --> 00:03:38.246
[ crow caws]♪ Maw and gulf

00:03:39.812 --> 00:03:42.511
♪ Double, double

00:03:42.554 --> 00:03:45.078
♪ Toil and trouble

00:03:45.122 --> 00:03:47.298
♪ Fire burn

00:03:47.342 --> 00:03:49.953
♪ And cauldron bubble

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:52.564
♪ Double, double
toil and trouble ♪

00:03:52.608 --> 00:03:55.263
♪ Fire burn
and cauldron bubble ♪

00:03:55.306 --> 00:03:57.830
♪ Double, double
toil and trouble ♪

00:03:57.874 --> 00:04:02.966
♪ Fire burn
and cauldron bubble ♪

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:06.186
♪ Something wicked
this way comes. ♪

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:07.666
[ frog croaks]

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:09.799
[ applause]

00:04:09.842 --> 00:04:14.064
Welcome, welcome
to another year at Hogwarts.

00:04:14.107 --> 00:04:15.805
Now, I'd like to say a few words

00:04:15.848 --> 00:04:18.329
before we all become
too befuddled

00:04:18.373 --> 00:04:20.157
by our excellent feast.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:24.030
First, I'm pleased to welcome
Professor R.J. Lupin,

00:04:24.074 --> 00:04:25.989
who's kindly consented
to fill the post

00:04:26.032 --> 00:04:29.775
of Defense Against
the Dark Arts teacher.

00:04:29.819 --> 00:04:31.342
Good luck, Professor.

00:04:31.386 --> 00:04:34.345
[ applause]

00:04:35.085 --> 00:04:36.695
HERMIONE:
Of course--

00:04:36.739 --> 00:04:39.002
that's why he knew to give
you the chocolate, Harry.

00:04:39.045 --> 00:04:41.091
Potter. Potter!

00:04:41.134 --> 00:04:42.571
Is it true you fainted?

00:04:42.614 --> 00:04:43.789
[ mock sigh]

00:04:43.833 --> 00:04:45.835
I mean, you
actually fainted?

00:04:45.878 --> 00:04:46.836
Shove off, Malfoy!

00:04:46.879 --> 00:04:48.011
How did he find out?

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:49.404
Just forget it.

00:04:49.447 --> 00:04:50.883
DUMBLEDORE:
...Care of Magical Creatures

00:04:50.927 --> 00:04:53.016
teacher for many years,
has decided to retire

00:04:53.059 --> 00:04:57.368
in order to spend more time
with his remaining limbs.

00:04:57.412 --> 00:04:59.849
Fortunately,
I'm delighted to announce

00:04:59.892 --> 00:05:05.550
that his place will be taken
by none other than our own...

00:05:05.594 --> 00:05:07.944
Rubeus Hagrid.

00:05:07.987 --> 00:05:10.947
[ applause]

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:13.471
[ loud clattering]

00:05:13.515 --> 00:05:15.386
[ cheering and applause]

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:17.519
[ whistling and whooping]

00:05:17.562 --> 00:05:19.129
DUMBLEDORE:
Finally,

00:05:19.172 --> 00:05:21.784
on a more disquieting note,

00:05:21.827 --> 00:05:24.569
at the request
of the Ministry of Magic,

00:05:24.613 --> 00:05:26.745
Hogwarts will,
until further notice,

00:05:26.789 --> 00:05:29.792
play host
to the dementors of Azkaban

00:05:29.835 --> 00:05:33.230
until such a time
as Sirius Black is captured.

00:05:33.273 --> 00:05:35.058
[ students murmuring]

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:36.451
The dementors will be stationed

00:05:36.494 --> 00:05:38.409
at every entrance
to the grounds.

00:05:38.453 --> 00:05:39.889
Now, whilst I've been assured

00:05:39.932 --> 00:05:42.065
that their presence
will not disrupt

00:05:42.108 --> 00:05:44.676
our day-to-day activities...

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:46.243
a word of caution.

00:05:46.286 --> 00:05:47.897
Dementors are vicious creatures.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:50.813
They will not distinguish
between the one they hunt

00:05:50.856 --> 00:05:53.293
and the one
who gets in their way.

00:05:53.337 --> 00:05:56.645
Therefore, I must warn
each and every one of you

00:05:56.688 --> 00:06:00.562
to give them no reason
to harm you.

00:06:00.605 --> 00:06:07.569
It is not in the nature
of a dementor to be forgiving.

00:06:07.612 --> 00:06:12.138
But, you know,
happiness can be found,

00:06:12.182 --> 00:06:16.099
even in the darkest of times...

00:06:16.142 --> 00:06:22.018
if one only remembers
to turn on the light.

00:06:23.106 --> 00:06:26.109
♪

